  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leave No Girl Behind Plus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will enable a new cohort of 5000 extremely marginalised out-of-school girls to complete a full cycle of primary education through Accelerated Learning Programme (ALP) classes and transition to further opportunities. Graduates will be equipped with literacy and numeracy skills and 21st century leadership skills needed for them to envisage and pursue future pathways, make and advocate for their own decisions, and contribute to their community and society.</narrative>
  </description>
